# View Transitions Accessibility

## Principle
View Transitions enhance UX but must remain accessible.

## Guidelines
- Respect `prefers-reduced-motion`
- Ensure focus management after transition
- Provide fallback for browsers without support
- Keep transition durations under 500ms
- Announce route changes to screen readers

## Implementation
```astro
---
import { viewTransitions } from 'astro:transitions';
---
<html>
  <head>
    <viewTransitions />
  </head>
</html>
```

Use CSS media query:
```css
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  * { view-transition-name: none !important; }
}
```
